\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Ere I sleep, for every favour
\par This day showed
\par By my God,
\par I will bless my Saviour.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. O my Lord, what shall I render
\par To Thy name,
\par Still the same,
\par Merciful and tender?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thou hast ordered all my goings
\par In Thy way,
\par Heard me pray,
\par Sanctified my doings.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Leave me not, but ever love me;
\par Let Thy peace
\par Be my bliss,
\par Till Thou hence remove us.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Thou my rock, my guard, my tower,
\par Safely keep,
\par While I sleep,
\par Me, with all Thy power.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. So, whene'er in death I slumber,
\par Let me rise
\par With the wise,
\par Counted in their number.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

